{
  "project": "AuditLens",
  "title": "AuditLens 比赛展示：问题、用法、前后变化与价值",
  "category": "Walkthrough",
  "description": "3–5 分钟参赛 Demo：解决什么问题 → 如何使用 → 使用前后变化 → 带来的价值。",
  "output_name": "01-competition-demo",
  "viewport": { "width": 1440, "height": 900 },
  "use_setup_login": false,
  "show_cursor": true,
  "steps_summary": [
    "痛点：解决什么问题",
    "用法：登录上传并启动分析",
    "加速等待流水线",
    "前后对比：结果、证据与报告",
    "价值收尾"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "open_login",
      "action": "navigate",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/login",
      "narration": "各位评委好。今天演示的作品是 AuditLens AI——智能财务风险审计工作台。",
      "highlight": "p.text-lg.font-semibold",
      "highlight_label": "AuditLens AI",
      "action_ms": 600,
      "wait_for": "#email"
    },
    {
      "id": "state_problem",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "它要解决的问题很具体：财务流水量大，人工抽检覆盖有限；发现问题后，又常常缺凭证、缺制度依据；整改跟进还散落在邮件和表格里，难以闭环。",
      "highlight": "h1",
      "highlight_label": "痛点场景",
      "action_ms": 700
    },
    {
      "id": "fill_email",
      "action": "fill",
      "selector": "#email",
      "value": "${email}",
      "action_ms": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "fill_password",
      "action": "fill",
      "selector": "#password",
      "value": "${password}",
      "action_ms": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "pre_login",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "接下来按真实使用路径演示：登录、上传、自动审计、复核证据、带走报告。",
      "highlight": "button[type=\"submit\"]",
      "highlight_label": "登录",
      "action_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "submit_login",
      "action": "click",
      "selector": "button[type=\"submit\"]",
      "action_ms": 800,
      "wait_for_url": "/dashboard",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 25000
    },
    {
      "id": "go_upload",
      "action": "navigate",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/upload",
      "narration": "第一步，上传 Excel 或 CSV 财务流水。系统会自动跑六步流水线：解析、规则检查、异常检测、风险评分、制度解释，再生成报告。",
      "highlight": "div[role=\"button\"]",
      "highlight_label": "上传区",
      "action_ms": 700,
      "wait_for": "input[type=\"file\"]"
    },
    {
      "id": "select_file",
      "action": "upload",
      "selector": "input[type=\"file\"]",
      "value": "/Users/kongyanan/Documents/code/AuditLens/fixtures/demo-financial-audit.csv",
      "action_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "file_ready",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "样本已选好。关键原则是：规则先给出可复现的硬结论，AI 只解释「为何可疑」，不替代判责。",
      "highlight": "button:has-text(\"开始分析\")",
      "highlight_label": "开始分析",
      "action_ms": 500,
      "wait_for": "button:has-text(\"开始分析\")"
    },
    {
      "id": "pre_analyze",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "点击开始分析后，流水线可能要跑一会儿。成片里这段会切成加速垫片，避免大家干等。",
      "highlight": "button:has-text(\"开始分析\")",
      "highlight_label": "分析中",
      "action_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "run_analyze_offrecord",
      "action": "click",
      "selector": "button:has-text(\"开始分析\")",
      "offrecord": true,
      "upload_before": "/Users/kongyanan/Documents/code/AuditLens/fixtures/demo-financial-audit.csv",
      "accelerate_caption": "【视频加速中】审计流水线运行中",
      "wait_for_url": "/dashboard",
      "wait_for": "text=综合风险评分",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 240000,
      "action_ms": 800
    },
    {
      "id": "wait_dashboard_ready",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "结果回来了。看使用前后的变化：以前靠抽检碰运气；现在同一批流水全量扫描，一眼看到综合风险分、问题总数、高风险项，以及已生成 AI 解释的条数。",
      "highlight": "div.grid",
      "highlight_label": "风险指标",
      "action_ms": 800,
      "wait_for": "text=综合风险评分",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "id": "show_brief",
      "action": "scroll",
      "selector": "text=管理层摘要",
      "value": "down",
      "narration": "管理层摘要把结论压成一页：风险档位、覆盖范围，还有优先整改 Top3。领导三十秒就能抓住重点。",
      "highlight": "text=管理层摘要",
      "highlight_label": "管理层摘要",
      "action_ms": 700,
      "wait_for": "text=优先整改 Top3",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 15000
    },
    {
      "id": "open_issue",
      "action": "click",
      "selector": "button[aria-expanded=\"false\"]",
      "narration": "展开一条高风险事项。以前发现问题还得回头翻表；现在规则命中、政策依据和关联凭证都在眼前，复核成本明显下降。",
      "highlight": "button[aria-expanded=\"false\"]",
      "highlight_label": "风险事项",
      "action_ms": 900,
      "wait_for": "text=工单状态",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 12000
    },
    {
      "id": "show_evidence",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "证据链旁边就是工单状态：待复核、确认风险、分派整改、验收关闭。整改不再断在邮件里，跟进路径清晰可追溯。",
      "highlight": "text=工单状态",
      "highlight_label": "工单与证据",
      "action_ms": 800
    },
    {
      "id": "pre_report",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "最后打开正式报告。报告是四章结构：执行摘要、发现项、风险分析、整改建议；也可以下载 Markdown、复制或打印，留下可归档底稿。",
      "highlight": "a[href^=\"/report/\"]",
      "highlight_label": "查看报告",
      "action_ms": 400,
      "wait_for": "a[href^=\"/report/\"]"
    },
    {
      "id": "open_report",
      "action": "click",
      "selector": "a[href^=\"/report/\"]",
      "action_ms": 500,
      "wait_for_url": "/report/",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 20000
    },
    {
      "id": "report_overview",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "所以变化可以概括成三句话：从抽检到全量扫描，从口头跟进到证据与工单闭环，从散落表格到可归档正式报告。",
      "highlight": "section",
      "highlight_label": "审计报告",
      "action_ms": 700,
      "wait_for": "button:has-text(\"下载 Markdown\")",
      "wait_timeout_ms": 15000
    },
    {
      "id": "show_value",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "带来的价值也很清楚：覆盖率更高，证据力更强，闭环可验收，并且核心能力不依赖大模型是否可用——规则判风险，AI 只解释。",
      "highlight": "button:has-text(\"下载 Markdown\")",
      "highlight_label": "导出底稿",
      "action_ms": 800
    },
    {
      "id": "closing",
      "action": "wait",
      "narration": "总结：AuditLens 不是聊天套壳，而是可审计的决策工作台——发现问题、解释依据、推动整改、带走底稿，一条路径走完。谢谢各位评委。",
      "highlight": "section",
      "highlight_label": "AuditLens",
      "action_ms": 1200
    }
  ]
}
